        <string>Individually fit the genuine native O contours into the broad lower oval, retaining native horizontal stroke weights and side profiles. Build rising arms at measured native Y diagonal weight and a hanging interior stroke. Use each cut separately in its own italic axis; this is optical reconstruction of this letter, not uniform cap reduction or upright shearing.</string>
